{"id":"radi","lemma":"ради","pos":"prep","rank":199,"glosses":["for the sake of"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ad/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы здесь ради тебя.","en":"We're here for you.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Они здесь ради меня.","en":"They're here for me.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Я здесь не ради вас.","en":"I'm not here for you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Я сделал это ради него.","en":"I did it for him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"he, it","l":"он"}]},{"text":"Я ради этого живу.","en":"That's what I live for.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"to live","l":"жить"}]}]}